+Redaction: card-number-like digit runs, security codes (CVC/CVV) and passwords/PINs are replaced with placeholders before the ticket is sent to the model, and again in the model's summary and in the subject fallback. The ticket itself is not modified. This is pattern-based: a password written as a bare word with no cue ("I typed Tulip") cannot be recognised.
